Elbereth 'star-queen' also Varda 'the exalted' is the spouse of Manwe.
Both are the greatest of Ainur (Ainur=Angelic spirits, offspring of the
thought of Iluvatar. (Iluvatar=God)). Varda is concerned with light. She
made the stars upon which elves looked upon when they came to the world
and thus their love to Elbereth, as they call Varda. She also filled the
Lamps of the Valar with light, collected the dews of the Two Trees in her
Wells, hallowed the Silmarils, established the courses of the Moon and Sun,
and set the star Earendil in the sky. Other names for her include Tintalle, 
Gilthoniel, Elentari, Lady of the Stars, Fanuilos and Snow-white.
